  "body": "## 新增功能\r\n\r\n- 新增「睡觉时安静」玩家设置（默认开启）：开启后，女仆睡觉时不会自言自语、互聊或打招呼，可在 AI 聊天界面的 💬 设置中调整\r\n- 该设置不受管理员开关限制，玩家始终可以修改\r\n\r\n此版本服务端不兼容之前版本的客户端，若在服务器中更新，那么在服务器中游玩的玩家都需要更新\r\n\r\n## 下载方式\r\n\r\n- CurseForge：https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/touhoulittlemaid-self-talk\r\n- Modrinth：审核中\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n\r\n- New \"Sleep Quiet\" player setting (enabled by default): when on, maids will no longer self-talk, inter-chat, or greet while sleeping. Adjust it from the 💬 button in the AI chat screen\r\n- Not restricted by the admin's player-settings toggle; players can always change it\r\n\r\nThis sever version is not compatible with previous client versions. If you update the mod on your server, all players on it need to update the mod as well.\r\n\r\n## Download\r\n\r\n- CurseForge: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/touhoulittlemaid-self-talk\r\n- Modrinth: Under review"
